    "The summary claims the board is 'unchanged except Director 5 appointed 2021-05-04', but the record shows Director 1 was appointed on 2016-02-01, which is also a change relative to the company's incorporation in 1993, making the statement technically inaccurate regarding the full history of the board composition."
  ],
  "missed_risks": [
    "The summary fails to mention that the company's net working capital has turned negative (RM-448k in FY2024), indicating a liquidity crunch beyond just the quick ratio.",
